  "unresolved": [
    "The initial rules cover selected documented API differences only; the full Source RBS 4.2.0 core audit against each exact Target Ruby is incomplete.",
    "Set and Pathname promotion to core, their cross-references, and earlier stdlib availability require review before publication.",
    "Ractor redesign, Fiber scheduler hooks, Range semantics, RubyVM APIs, and other unreviewed Ruby 3.4/4.0 differences require target-specific rules or evidence that no shift is needed.",
    "Time xmlschema and iso8601 core versus stdlib availability has not been independently validated for each target.",
    "Actual CRuby 3.3.12 and 3.4.11 runtime validation and Rigor integration on the supported platform remain outstanding."
  ],
